00:22:22.760 --> 00:22:25.170
that hasn't been, been discussed much

00:22:25.170 --> 00:22:27.300
and cost-effectiveness.

00:22:27.300 --> 00:22:31.610
Then zooming back a little
bit, the economics is talking

00:22:31.610 --> 00:22:33.240
more about kinda place-specific effects,

00:22:33.240 --> 00:22:34.850
so whether that's immigrant enclaves

00:22:34.850 --> 00:22:36.930
or in general neighborhood effects

00:22:36.930 --> 00:22:39.610
and I think it's important
here to think about this

00:22:39.610 --> 00:22:41.150
in terms of humanitarian context

00:22:41.150 --> 00:22:44.360
and a place that is actually
created that the social planner

00:22:44.360 --> 00:22:46.543
has a choice of whether to create or not.

